          "kind": "narrate",
          "text": "One morning, as you cut barley in the low field, a host of the king's guard rides through the standing crop as though it were water.",
          "pause": false,
          "role": "introduction"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narrate",
          "text": "They tell you the king has called every man between twenty-two and thirty-five to the Dark Mountain. You have seven days to reach Hagan's Castle.",
